{"id":"kingyo/2","storyId":"kingyo","number":2,"title":{"en":"Mina's Secret","zh":"美奈的秘密","ja":"ミナのひみつ"},"summary":{"en":"Kin-chan still hasn't turned up. Mina is acting strangely, and she won't let anyone near the bathroom.","zh":"小金还是没找到。美奈的样子很奇怪，她不让任何人靠近浴室。"},"paragraphs":[[{"id":"kingyo/2/1","t":[{"f":"木曜日[もくようび]","r":"もくようび","l":"木曜日"},{"f":"、","p":1},{"f":"晴[は]れ","r":"はれ","l":"晴れ"},{"f":"。","p":1}],"tr":{"en":"Thursday. Sunny.","zh":"星期四，晴。"},"say":"木曜日、晴れ。","b":[{"from":0,"to":0,"r":"time","h":"time","g":{"en":"Thursday","zh":"星期四"}},{"from":2,"to":2,"r":"pred","h":"pred","g":{"en":"sunny","zh":"晴"}}]},{"id":"kingyo/2/2","t":[{"f":"キンちゃん","r":"キンちゃん","l":"キンちゃん"},{"f":"は","r":"は","l":"は"},{"f":"まだ","r":"まだ","l":"まだ"},{"f":"見[み]つかりません","r":"みつかりません","l":"見つかる","i":{"en":"polite negative","zh":"礼貌体否定"}},{"f":"。","p":1}],"tr":{"en":"Kin-chan still hasn't been found.","zh":"小金还是没找到。"},"say":"キンちゃんはまだ見つかりません。","g":[{"id":"mada-mou","from":2,"to":3}],"b":[{"from":0,"to":1,"r":"topic","h":"topic:は","g":{"en":"as for Kin-chan","zh":"小金"}},{"from":2,"to":2,"r":"adv","g":{"en":"still","zh":"还"}},{"from":3,"to":3,"r":"pred","h":"pred","g":{"en":"isn't found","zh":"没找到"}}]},{"id":"kingyo/2/3","t":[{"f":"学校[がっこう]","r":"がっこう","l":"学校"},{"f":"で","r":"で","l":"で"},{"f":"、","p":1},{"f":"先生[せんせい]","r":"せんせい","l":"先生"},{"f":"に","r":"に","l":"に"},{"f":"その","r":"その","l":"その"},{"f":"話[はなし]","r":"はなし","l":"話"},{"f":"を","r":"を","l":"を"},{"f":"しました","r":"しました","l":"する","i":{"en":"polite past","zh":"礼貌体过去式"}},{"f":"。","p":1}],"tr":{"en":"At school, I told my teacher about it.","zh":"在学校，我把这件事告诉了老师。"},"say":"学校で、先生にその話をしました。","b":[{"from":0,"to":1,"r":"place","h":"place:で","g":{"en":"at school","zh":"在学校"}},{"from":3,"to":4,"r":"goal","h":"goal:に","g":{"en":"to the teacher","zh":"对老师"}},{"from":5,"to":7,"r":"obj","h":"obj:を","g":{"en":"that story","zh":"那件事"}},{"from":8,"to":8,"r":"pred","h":"pred","g":{"en":"told","zh":"说了"}}]},{"id":"kingyo/2/4","t":[{"f":"先生[せんせい]","r":"せんせい","l":"先生"